    /// a tile of up to 64 consecutive query tokens of one sequence, warp w owning query rows 16w..16w+15 with all head
    /// dims. Per chunk of 32 key positions the block stages K (row-major) and V (transposed) in shared memory once for
    /// all 64 queries; each warp computes its 16x32 scores with mma, runs the online softmax in registers (quad
    /// shuffles), turns the score accumulators directly into the fp16 A operand of P·V and accumulates its 16 x hd output
    /// tile in registers. Per-row key ranges (tokInfo) give causal, sliding-window or full masks. hd is a JIT constant
    /// (multiple of 16, ≤ 64, == HdV). Grid: tiles × NHead.
